From: LIVI OS maintainers <livi-os@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Place psplash messages in the artwork's bottom margin

The full-screen LIVI artwork uses the lower split area for the logo tagline.
Put runtime messages at the bottom of the framebuffer instead, where the image
has a black margin.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [appliance artwork layout]
Signed-off-by: LIVI OS maintainers <livi-os@localhost>
---
 psplash.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/psplash.c b/psplash.c
--- a/psplash.c
+++ b/psplash.c
@@ -49,6 +49,6 @@ psplash_draw_msg (PSplashFB *fb, const char *msg)
   psplash_fb_draw_rect (fb, 
 			0, 
-			SPLIT_LINE_POS(fb) - h, 
+			fb->height - h,
 			fb->width,
 			h,
 			PSPLASH_BACKGROUND_COLOR);
@@ -56,6 +56,6 @@ psplash_draw_msg (PSplashFB *fb, const char *msg)
   psplash_fb_draw_text (fb,
 			(fb->width-w)/2, 
-			SPLIT_LINE_POS(fb) - h,
+			fb->height - h,
 			PSPLASH_TEXT_COLOR,
 			&FONT_DEF,
 			msg);
